 Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  12 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 16 28 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy short stitch superior  long stitch lateral  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm yellow  lobular  dense  tan  fibrous lumpectomy specimen with a long stitch indicating the lateral margin and a short stitch indicating the superior margin  The specimen is inked according to protocol  superior green  inferior yellow  posterior black  anterior blue  The specimen is serially sectioned along the medial to lateral axis  The cut surface shows yellow lobular tissue admixed with fibrous tissue with no discrete masses identified  The prior biopsy site is also not definitively identified  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes A K  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margins  superior half  consists of a 40 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm aggregate of yellow tan fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes L S  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margins  inferior half  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of yellow and tan fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes T BB  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left axillary node dissection  consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm yellow tan fibrofatty tissue containing multiple lymph nodes  The lymph nodes are dissected out  One lymph node each is submitted in cassettes CC LL  Cassettes MM NN contain multiple lymph nodes  Resident  MINDY J  HULL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE LEFT AXILLA  DISSECTION PART B  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST LEFT  SUPERIOR REMOVED_DATE SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION PART D  BREAST LEFT  INFERIOR REMOVED_DATE SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION , Unchecked.
