ns  The specimen bears a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm blue dye injected  superior and anterior  skin  and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm unremarkable nipple  The specimen is black inked and sectioned to reveal REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm  centrally located extremely firm tan pink well circumscribed mass which is located 0 2cm from the deep margin  closest margin  Representative sections are submitted  SECTION CODE F G  Mass to inferior margin H I  Mass J K  Mass to anterior margin L  Mass inferior and lateral M O  Mass central and lateral P  Uninvolved fibrosis parenchyma  lateral Labeled  additional right axillary node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm axillary content predominantly composed of yellow red fatty tissue  Several nodes are dissected and submitted entirely as Q R  Resident  SOHEIL DADRAS  MD  PHD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   1A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   BIOPSY  ATYPICAL CELLS  SUSPICIOUS FOR TUMOR CELLS  AWAIT PERMANENTS FOR CLARIFICATION  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY  NON SENTINEL   BIOPSY  ATYPICAL CELLS  SUSPICIOUS FOR TUMOR CELLS  AWAIT PERMANENTS FOR CLARIFICATION  O R  Resident  DI TIAN  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL LYMPH NODE PART B  RIGHT AXILLARY NON SENTINEL LYMPH NODE PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY PART D  ADDITION OF RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODE , Checked.
