val is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  25 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 12 54 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm unoriented fibrofatty breast tissue with a localization needle in place  and an accompanying radiograph  The specimen is inked and serially sectioned to display a predominately tan pink dense fibrous tissue with a minimal amount of tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes A D with the area of calcifications in cassette B C  Also received in the same container  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm unoriented fibrofatty breast tissue which is inked serially sectioned and entirely submitted as E  Gross Description by  JAMES BARRY Resident  Grace T  McKee MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
