on margin with the suture  D N  remaining tumor  Labeled  Lateral breast   B  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm piece of fibrofatty tissue  Inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable breast parenchyma  Submitted entirely in O and P  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS   LATERAL MASS   NO GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS LESION IDENTIFIED  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT   BIOPSY  INFILTRATING CARCINOMA CONSISTENT WITH BREAST DUCTAL TYPE O R  Resident  Jason Lockridge  MD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST MASS PART B  RIGHT BREAST MASS PART C  LATERAL MASS   report_end  , Unchecked.
