 larger specimen  E F  representative sections of the biopsy cavity  with skin and scar  of the large piece  G I  representative sections of the biopsy cavity wall  and inked margin of the smaller piece  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Axillary contents  is a 9 x 7 x 1cm piece of yellow fibrofatty tissue with several lymph nodes measuring up to 2cm in greatest diameter  Most of the lymph nodes are soft  however  a lymph node measuring 1cm in greatest diameter  and two smaller lymph nodes are firm  J P  representative sections of axillary lymph nodes  Resident  Douglas B  Flieder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   AXILLARY CONTENT  RIGHT    report_end  , Unchecked.
