ateral aspect  0 7cm from the anterior aspect  1 0cm from the medial aspect  and 1 4cm from the inferior aspect  The surrounding uninvolved parenchyma is unremarkable  tan yellow to pink  fibrofatty tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE  A D  Mass  to closest posterior margin in cassette A   E F  Uninvolved parenchyma with the lateral margin radially sectioned in cassette F  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary sentinel node   are two tan pink lymph nodes  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  which are submitted in toto in cassette G  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary non sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan pink  fatty lymph node  with a minimum amount of attached tan yellow  lobulated adipose tissue  which is bisected and entirely submitted in cassette H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  deep margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular  tan pink to yellow portion of fibrofatty tissue  with a black suture on one aspect  which is inked black  and the opposing blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a tan yellow  pink  unremarkable  fibrofatty surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I N  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  superior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular  blue stained portion of tan yellow to pink  fibrofatty tissue  with a black suture on one aspect  The sutured aspect is inked black  and the opposing blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a tan yellow to pink  blue stained  unremarkable  fibrofatty cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes O R  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  an