ue surrounding the cavity  The remaining cut surface consist of yellow lobulated fatty tissue  Representative sections are submitted as labeled  A  Cavity to posterior margin  B C  Cavity to nipple and posterior margin  D  Cavity and surrounding fibrous tissue  E F  Uninvolved  G H  Possible axillary lymph nodes  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  additional left axillary  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of fatty tissue that contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan pink lymph node which is bisected and entirely submitted  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   Gross Description by  JANEL M  RENNA Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  MJF                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Mary Catherine Hertl  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION , Unchecked.
